        "html": "<div class=\"move-block\" id=\"improved-stat\" data-move=\"sheet\"><h3 class=\"move-name\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"mv-improved-stat\" data-check-id=\"mv-improved-stat\" aria-label=\"IMPROVED STAT\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"mv-improved-stat-2\" data-check-id=\"mv-improved-stat-2\" aria-label=\"IMPROVED STAT\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"mv-improved-stat-3\" data-check-id=\"mv-improved-stat-3\" aria-label=\"IMPROVED STAT\"> FORBEDRET EGENSKAP</h3><p>Hver gang du tar dette trekket, øk en av egenskapene dine med 1 (til maks +2).</p></div>",
