        "html": "<h3 id=\"undefined\">Ubestemt</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\">\n<div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-undef\"><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-0\" title=\"Merk 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-0\" aria-label=\"Merk 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-1\" title=\"Merk 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-1\" aria-label=\"Merk 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-2\" title=\"Merk 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-2\" aria-label=\"Merk 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-3\" title=\"Merk 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-3\" aria-label=\"Merk 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-4\" title=\"Merk 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-4\" aria-label=\"Merk 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-5\" title=\"Merk 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-5\" aria-label=\"Merk 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-6\" title=\"Merk 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-6\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-6\" aria-label=\"Merk 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-7\" title=\"Merk 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-7\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-7\" aria-label=\"Merk 8\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-8\" title=\"Merk 9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-8\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-8\" aria-label=\"Merk 9\"></label></span></div>\n</div>\n<p>Når du <strong><em>Har Det Du Trenger</em></strong>, flytt et merke herfra til et bestemt ◇ nedenfor.</p>",
