        "html": "<div class=\"roll-table\" id=\"theme\"><div class=\"roll-table-head\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"dice-roll\" data-dice=\"1d12\" title=\"Klikk og slå 1d12 — Shift: fordel · Ctrl: ulempe\">1d12</button> <span class=\"roll-label\">tema</span></div><table><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">1-2</th><td>Selve jorden/mold/stein</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">3-4</th><td>Landets dyr/luftens fugler</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">5-6</th><td>Det som gror (planter, sopp, jordbruk osv.)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">7</th><td><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"spirits-of-the-wild.html\" data-slug=\"spirits-of-the-wild\" >Villmarkas ånder</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">8</th><td>Ville, utemmede steder</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">9</th><td>Fruktbarhet/forplantning/(gjen)fødsel</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">10</th><td>Hemmeligheter/mysterier/bindinger</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">11</th><td>Den naturlige orden/årstidene/kretsløpene</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">12</th><td>Helbredelse/renselse/beskyttelse</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
