        "name": "quarry",
        "html": "<div class=\"roll-table\" id=\"quarry\"><div class=\"roll-table-head\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"dice-roll\" data-dice=\"1d6\" title=\"Klikk og slå 1d6 — Shift: fordel · Ctrl: ulempe\">1d6</button> <span class=\"roll-label\">bytte</span></div><table><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">1-2</th><td>Ingenting … ennå.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">3-4</th><td>Ussel fangst: en rev/kanin/villsvin/hjort, <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"crinwin.html#crinwin\" data-slug=\"crinwin\" data-fragment=\"crinwin\" >crinwin</a>, en tosk som krysset veien hans osv.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">5</th><td>Verdig bytte: <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-great-wood.html#ceirwmawr\" data-slug=\"the-great-wood\" data-fragment=\"ceirwmawr\" >en ceirwmawr</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-great-wood.html#raselbaedd\" data-slug=\"the-great-wood\" data-fragment=\"raselbaedd\" >en raselbaedd</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"spirits-of-the-wild.html\" data-slug=\"spirits-of-the-wild\" >en dyrevokter</a>, en <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"fae.html#the-fae\" data-slug=\"fae\" data-fragment=\"the-fae\" >fae</a> han har inngått et veddemål med osv.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">6</th><td>Udødt bytte: <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"death-and-the-undying.html\" data-slug=\"death-and-the-undying\" >et spøkelse</a> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"death-and-the-undying.html\" data-slug=\"death-and-the-undying\" >eller en gjenganger</a>, tatt ute i det åpne, <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"death-and-the-undying.html\" data-slug=\"death-and-the-undying\" >langt fra noen dooltrær</a>.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
